{"ts": "2026-07-05T16:38:31+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "17b801cd768ca03b2e24d2154e27c02c", "span_id": "ecffe902babd960b", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "2A48EA16", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_817ad613-c6dd-4e5f-872e-ef2d7784ca9b', 'response': 'Based on the FAB Credit Pricing Policy, the pricing floor for a BB-rated facility depends on the specific product type and tenor. The floors are expressed as a spread in basis points (bps) over the applicable internal Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 3.1].\\n\\n**1. Corporate Term Loans**\\n| Tenor Category | Minimum Pricing Floor (bps) |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| Tenor ≤ 1 Year | **165 bps** |\\n| Tenor 1-3 Years | **210 bps** |\\n| Tenor 3-5 Years | **260 bps** |\\n| Tenor > 5 Years | **320 bps** |\\n\\n**2. Revolving Credit Facilities (RCFs)**\\nFor RCFs, the pricing floors for a BB-rated client are as follows [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 3.2]:\\n* **Drawn Margin Floor:** 160 bps\\n* **Commitment Fee Floor:** 40 bps\\n* **Facility Fee Floor:** 20 bps\\n* *Tenure Adjustment:* Facilities with a tenure greater than 3 years require an addition of 40 bps.\\n\\n**Additional Policy Notes:**\\n* **Relationship Value Adjustments:** The required margin may be reduced by up to 25 bps if the client demonstrates material cross-sell revenues (exceeding AED 500,000 annually) and receives the required credit authority approval [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 2.4].\\n* **Below-Floor Exceptions:** Any pricing proposed below these standard floors requires a formal \"Pricing Exception\" with the appropriate approval authority (Segment Credit Head or Country/Group Credit Committee, depending on the deviation) [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 6.2].'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-05T16:38:34+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "17b801cd768ca03b2e24d2154e27c02c", "span_id": "ecffe902babd960b", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "2A48EA16", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Pricing floor for a BB‑rated AED loan**\\n\\n- **Corporate Term Loans**  \\n  | Tenor | Minimum floor (bps) |\\n  |------|--------------------|\\n  | ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear | **165\\u202fbps** |\\n  | 1‑3\\u202fYears | **210\\u202fbps** |\\n  | 3‑5\\u202fYears | **260\\u202fbps** |\\n  | >\\u202f5\\u202fYears | **320\\u202fbps** |\\n\\n- **Revolving Credit Facilities (RCFs)**  \\n  | Component | Minimum floor (bps) |\\n  |-----------|---------------------|\\n  | Drawn margin | **160\\u202fbps** |\\n  | Commitment fee | **40\\u202fbps** |\\n  | Facility fee | **20\\u202fbps** |\\n  | Tenure\\u202f>\\u202f3\\u202fyears (add‑on) | **+40\\u202fbps** |\\n\\n> **Source:** FAB Credit Pricing Policy v2.4, Section\\u202f3.1 (Term Loans) & Section\\u202f3.2 (RCFs).\\n\\n**Action recommendation** – Apply the appropriate floor based on the loan type and tenor; obtain a formal Pricing Exception if a price below these floors is proposed.  \\n\\n<llm_reasoning>{\"phase\":\"synthesis\",\"sources_used\":[\"query_knowledge_base\"],\"key_findings\":[\"BB-rated term‑loan floors\",\"BB-rated RCF floors\",\"policy source citation\"],\"answer_rationale\":\"Combined the policy tables for term loans and revolving facilities to present the applicable pricing floors for BB‑rated AED loans\",\"steps\":[\"identified hybrid intent with knowledge‑only signals\",\"called query_knowledge_base for BB‑rated AED loan pricing floor\",\"retrieved policy tables and notes\",\"formatted answer with direct floor values and source citation\",\"provided concise action recommendation\"]}</llm_reasoning>'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-05T16:38:34+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "17b801cd768ca03b2e24d2154e27c02c", "span_id": "75d9a9241fb81e87", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "2A48EA16", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_817ad613-c6dd-4e5f-872e-ef2d7784ca9b', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What is the pricing floor for a BB-rated AED loan?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-05T16:38:34+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "17b801cd768ca03b2e24d2154e27c02c", "span_id": "75d9a9241fb81e87", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "2A48EA16", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_817ad613-c6dd-4e5f-872e-ef2d7784ca9b', 'response': 'Based on the FAB Credit Pricing Policy, the pricing floor for a BB-rated facility depends on the specific product type and tenor. The floors are expressed as a spread in basis points (bps) over the applicable internal Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 3.1].\\n\\n**1. Corporate Term Loans**\\n| Tenor Category | Minimum Pricing Floor (bps) |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| Tenor ≤ 1 Year | **165 bps** |\\n| Tenor 1-3 Years | **210 bps** |\\n| Tenor 3-5 Years | **260 bps** |\\n| Tenor > 5 Years | **320 bps** |\\n\\n**2. Revolving Credit Facilities (RCFs)**\\nFor RCFs, the pricing floors for a BB-rated client are as follows [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 3.2]:\\n* **Drawn Margin Floor:** 160 bps\\n* **Commitment Fee Floor:** 40 bps\\n* **Facility Fee Floor:** 20 bps\\n* *Tenure Adjustment:* Facilities with a tenure greater than 3 years require an addition of 40 bps.\\n\\n**Additional Policy Notes:**\\n* **Relationship Value Adjustments:** The required margin may be reduced by up to 25 bps if the client demonstrates material cross-sell revenues (exceeding AED 500,000 annually) and receives the required credit authority approval [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 2.4].\\n* **Below-Floor Exceptions:** Any pricing proposed below these standard floors requires a formal \"Pricing Exception\" with the appropriate approval authority (Segment Credit Head or Country/Group Credit Committee, depending on the deviation) [FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 6.2].'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-05T16:38:34+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "17b801cd768ca03b2e24d2154e27c02c", "span_id": "75d9a9241fb81e87", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "2A48EA16", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Pricing floor for a BB‑rated AED loan**\\n\\n- **Corporate Term Loans**  \\n  | Tenor | Minimum floor (bps) |\\n  |------|--------------------|\\n  | ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear | **165\\u202fbps** |\\n  | 1‑3\\u202fYears | **210\\u202fbps** |\\n  | 3‑5\\u202fYears | **260\\u202fbps** |\\n  | >\\u202f5\\u202fYears | **320\\u202fbps** |\\n\\n- **Revolving Credit Facilities (RCFs)**  \\n  | Component | Minimum floor (bps) |\\n  |-----------|---------------------|\\n  | Drawn margin | **160\\u202fbps** |\\n  | Commitment fee | **40\\u202fbps** |\\n  | Facility fee | **20\\u202fbps** |\\n  | Tenure\\u202f>\\u202f3\\u202fyears (add‑on) | **+40\\u202fbps** |\\n\\n> **Source:** FAB Credit Pricing Policy v2.4, Section\\u202f3.1 (Term Loans) & Section\\u202f3.2 (RCFs).\\n\\n**Action recommendation** – Apply the appropriate floor based on the loan type and tenor; obtain a formal Pricing Exception if a price below these floors is proposed.  \\n\\n<llm_reasoning>{\"phase\":\"synthesis\",\"sources_used\":[\"query_knowledge_base\"],\"key_findings\":[\"BB-rated term‑loan floors\",\"BB-rated RCF floors\",\"policy source citation\"],\"answer_rationale\":\"Combined the policy tables for term loans and revolving facilities to present the applicable pricing floors for BB‑rated AED loans\",\"steps\":[\"identified hybrid intent with knowledge‑only signals\",\"called query_knowledge_base for BB‑rated AED loan pricing floor\",\"retrieved policy tables and notes\",\"formatted answer with direct floor values and source citation\",\"provided concise action recommendation\"]}</llm_reasoning>'}]}"}
